VERDICT TOKEN-REALIZED-PAIR-ONLY-BY-THE-CONE-OWN-LAW: the sphere tower carries J = cyc3 and its own
  stage-crossing datum R_z(theta0) on one token with the exact witness (the circle tower carries neither);
  every pair law re-preparing each token only keeps |S| <= 2 (non-separable tables included), so phiW and
  cnot are out of reach; a cross-token law realizes phiW only if it takes the first readout's setting, and
  then it is forced to be the table's own conditioning rule, which reads the correlation block and needs
  cnot given.
